    "custom_multicolumns_xpBCAp": {
      "type": "custom-multicolumns",
      "blocks": {
        "column_W4R47Y": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "dynamic_costs": "",
            "custom_text_hover": "",
            "title": "",
            "show_text_double_column": false,
            "text": "<p>Our magnificent townhouse showroom in Clerkenwell has been such an exciting project, it has allowed us to display our cupboards in a very different way. We have gone for a more eclectic look with an emphasis on mixing vintage and new to make the space feel authentic and lived in. <br/><br/></p><p>Our love of East London, such places as Fournier Street and Malplaquet House in Mile End, has given us so much inspiration and taught us to love and embrace the history of our townhouse. From the handmade emerald green tiles to the colours on the walls, we</p>",
            "show_above_image": true,
            "link_label": "",
            "linked_product": ""
          }
        },
        "column_fB3ekK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "dynamic_costs": "",
            "custom_text_hover": "",
            "title": "",
            "show_text_double_column": false,
            "text": "<p>have created an opulent yet comfortable selection of kitchens for our customers to visit. We hope that it will inspire them to see not only the beauty of our furniture, but to see how naturally and easily it fits into these very special homes. <br/><br/></p><p>There is such a strong sense of history around this square and it’s preserved in the fascinating buildings and museums that surround it. The square is also full of delightful places to stop off for a coffee or a cocktail, all beautifully designed and stylish. You can even stay in the square in a traditional townhouse, sheer East End indulgence.</p>",
            "show_above_image": true,
            "link_label": "",
            "linked_product": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_W4R47Y",
        "column_fB3ekK"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (max-width: 500px) {.description_above--image {margin-bottom: -20px; } li#Slide-template--25344078741838__custom_multicolumns_xpBCAp-2 {margin-top: -20px; }}"
